        },
        {
          "text": "Ibikwc ronino madito me wi mwaka, pi c: mukwoŋo cek pi tic me ciŋi, i kom cam ma icoyo i poto; ki nino madito me nyonone i dero i agikki me mwaka, doŋ icoko gin ma ocek i poto pi ticci, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
